  "contentHtml": "<p>재과만에서 화학반응의 규칙 지식시장을 보고 만들었습니다!</p><p>저는 22칸 라벨지밖에 없어서 포인트 스티커 양식이 못생겨졌지만</p><p>16칸 라벨지가 있는 선생님들께서는 링크에 들어가셔서 양식을 받아서 쓰시는 게 더 나을 것 같아요ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c75633a4e83145d33b9a9ec3f39def59d9e647ed?download\" data-file-name=\"지식시장 암석.hwp\" data-file-size=\"74752\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D251%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20230314173045&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc75633a4e83145d33b9a9ec3f39def59d9e647ed')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">지식시장 암석</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">73.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1fb179420adab11b8c1c7a468b05c6cb8ff539f7?download\" data-file-name=\"지식시장 돈.hwp\" data-file-size=\"59392\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D251%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20230314173045&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F1fb179420adab11b8c1c7a468b05c6cb8ff539f7')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">지식시장 돈</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">58.00KB</div></div></a></div><p><a href=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/1778?searchView=Y\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/1778?searchView=Y</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"모든 이야기의 시작 - Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"매일매일 올라오는 즐거운 카페 이야기\" data-og-host=\"m.cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.ca